OL,3,GNEWSATeenager dies after car crashes
OL,4,Ainto tree
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has died after a car left a
OL,7,Froad and hit a tree, police have said.
OL,9,FThe crash, involving a white Fiat 500,
OL,10,Fhappened on Sheep Lane, in Woburn,
OL,11,FBedfordshire, close to the Flying Fox
OL,12,Froundabout, at about 23:00 BST on
OL,13,FSunday.
OL,15,FPolice said the car's only occupant, a
OL,16,Ffemale in her late teens, was
OL,17,Fpronounced dead at the scene, despite
OL,18,Fthe "extensive lifesaving efforts" of
OL,19,Fthe emergency services.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
